{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "e0971bc5e79e679d2e63f2b16dc10d822a6f12652fd2d68eaf65addb55e78af9", "ja": "歌番組のお仕事", "zh": "歌唱节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2000_place", "source_sha256": "d25d57bc2c20cfb97c2c62413237a10ed7b24c2c65b935a5fad4497b10378257", "ja": "番組スタジオ", "zh": "节目摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2001_p", "source_sha256": "346d1f805c7504ab9bc98cfd36f442e74d2da1a8f1d87af60a69cfa544159ad7", "ja": "今日の仕事は歌番組の収録だけど……\nエレナ、準備はいいか？", "zh": "今天的工作是歌唱节目的录影……\n艾琳娜，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2002_018ele", "source_sha256": "6e583eb714a0bd68e47d612604b5bb2f76015401947c04a1d6fc81dfad1ea21a", "ja": "うぅ、全然良くないヨー。緊張しちゃって……\n{$P$}、どうしたらいいのかナ？", "zh": "呜呜，一点也不好啦～我好紧张……\n{$P$}，我该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2003_p", "source_sha256": "fee6f24060deebe883814f0ecef5aeac5278af775ca8e86c13575ff950140f80", "ja": "そうか……じゃあ今日は、いったん歌のことは忘れて、\nダンスを中心に頑張ろう。それならできそうか？", "zh": "这样啊……那今天就暂时忘了唱歌的事，\n先专注于舞蹈吧，这样的话做得来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2004_018ele", "source_sha256": "55b917ab047d21d2cc4051aa8c2a730ac6d874714670e5ddcd8f1a8b5a15b7bc", "ja": "{$P$}……いいノ？", "zh": "{$P$}……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b537794226d3b11a2b338adf7424936f21c1222dcdbf504b4345afa9a08be817", "ja": "今みたいに悲しそうな顔をしてたら、どっちも上手く\nいかなくなっちゃうからな。エレナ、頑張れるか？", "zh": "要是让你像刚才那样露出悲伤的表情，\n反而会两边都表现不好。艾琳娜，有办法加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ed350237a4adcecb389f54fb4c5b34992ffceebf359eab6ecc7a34ca2f54ea3", "ja": "うん……わかった！　ワタシ、ダンスは得意だから……\n誰にも負けないように、頑張ってくるネ！", "zh": "嗯……我知道了！我很擅长跳舞……\n我会努力不输给任何人的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
